            {
              "id": "haw0005",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>Houseen was founded on a simple observation: exceptional homes are sold quietly, by people who understand them. We never chase volume. A property earns its place in our portfolio through architecture, provenance and potential — nothing else.</p><p>Our clients are founders, families and collectors across three continents. They return, and they refer. That is the entire business plan.</p>",
                "text_color": "#343635",
                "typography_typography": "custom",
                "typography_font_family": "Jost",
                "typography_font_size": { "unit": "px", "size": 17, "sizes": [] }
